## Interface: 16001, 16002
## Title: Aura Advisor
## Notes: Tells a Paladin when another aura fits the fight better, from the damage your party takes, pushed-back casts and enemy casters. Reminds a tank of Righteous Fury and tracks your blessings on the party. /aura for options.
